{"4725290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape Line", "steam_appid": 4725290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/extras/aeb3cdb406f825fbdc22c4a744188504.avif?t=1787315583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/extras_big/aeb3cdb406f825fbdc22c4a744188504.webp?t=1787315583 width=1560 height=225 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[Escape Line] is a yandere monster x Y/N visual novel game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">3 yandere sirens × you (female protagonist)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have a lot of nicknames. (So many!)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ What You Can Do:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a free robot butler right from the start!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance a siren / be pursued by them / get courted / escape / fail to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap a fish across the face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnaw on a coconut shell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggles between human and non-human, reality and illusion, nihilism and pain, giving up and holding on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick some unhinged, chaotic options to confuse the fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contemplate the mysteries of philosophy &amp; the meaning of &quot;Escape Line&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Morse code and quadruple encryption while brushing up on envelope curves and Sophie's World</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- ! WARNING ! -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Yandere / pregnancy mention / oviposition / heavy meta / horror / jump scares / mild blood /</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Non-human creatures / romance / new weird / mechanical /</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sci-fi / fantasy / philosophy…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">- <strong>CONTENTS</strong> -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85k+ script    9 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Chinese / English] — Switch languages in the settings screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >128 siren CGs (split variations included)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 human-group / robot CGs (split variations included)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >187 audio tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 video tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >156 backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Plus 20 Easter eggs</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The [guide / walkthrough] handbook can be found in the &quot;About&quot; screen — click the second line to open it in your browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It contains major spoilers and is not recommended for early viewing. If it fails to open — the author has an image-format guide posted on Tumblr.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for reading this far!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy the [Tides] system to its fullest!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/extras/aeb3cdb406f825fbdc22c4a744188504.avif?t=1787315583\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/extras_big/aeb3cdb406f825fbdc22c4a744188504.webp?t=1787315583 wid