] — Switch languages in the settings screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >128 siren CGs (split variations included)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 human-group / robot CGs (split variations included)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >187 audio tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 video tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >156 backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Plus 20 Easter eggs</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The [guide / walkthrough] handbook can be found in the &quot;About&quot; screen — click the second line to open it in your browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It contains major spoilers and is not recommended for early viewing. If it fails to open — the author has an image-format guide posted on Tumblr.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thank you for reading this far!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy the [Tides] system to its fullest!</h2>", "short_description": "Yandere · Monster Romance · Y/N game · Philosophical · Sci-Fi · Visual Novel Shipwrecked and stripped of memory, you awaken on a fog-shrouded island with nothing but the aid of two sirens — so, what's the price?", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/6bb9e4accb965f632237f0f35eaee2643bbb82ee/header.jpg?t=1787315583", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/4df065187bbe3d3178154ef3d6d906cbfa5aec2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787315583", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725290/4df065187bbe3d3178154ef3d6d906cbfa5aec2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787315583", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 6